      "final_text": "# Ending MRR by month, Q2 2026\n\nMy reading: `amount` is the **net change in MRR** for each month, not the month-end MRR. April's values are negative, and month-end MRR can't be negative. That means I can't give absolute month-end MRR without the MRR at 31 Dec 2025. Neither file has it, and it wasn't zero: about 100 customers were already active before 2026.\n\nSo each figure below is that unknown **31 Dec 2025 MRR (X) plus the changes added up from January**:\n\n| Month end | Enterprise | Mid-Market | SMB | **Total** | Change in month |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 30 Apr 2026 | X_E + 42,465 | X_MM + 21,295 | X_SMB + 12,130 | **X + 75,890** | −19,960 |\n| 31 May 2026 | X_E + 43,225 | X_MM + 27,175 | X_SMB + 15,265 | **X + 85,665** | +9,775 |\n| 30 Jun 2026 | X_E + 64,455 | X_MM + 43,960 | X_SMB + 19,815 | **X + 128,230** | +42,565 |\n\n- **Across Q2:** MRR rose by 32,380 in total: +8,705 Enterprise, +19,585 Mid-Market, +4,090 SMB.\n- **Compared with 31 Mar 2026** (X + 95,850): April fell, May recovered part of that, and June was the strongest month of the half-year.\n- **To get absolute numbers:** give me the MRR at 31 Dec 2025, or at 31 Mar 2026, and I'll add it in.\n\nThe amounts have no currency given, and I didn't use `customer_master.csv` because it has no revenue figures.\n\n```text\nHerkunft\n- Kennzahl: ending_mrr (ad hoc, keine Definition hinterlegt) v0\n- Art: Stand, aus Veränderungen kumuliert; Anfangsstand X fehlt\n- Zeitraum: 2026-04-01 bis 2026-06-30, Einheit Währung unbekannt, pro Monatsende\n- Quelle: monthly_revenue.csv, Spalte amount (als monatliche Netto-MRR-Veränderung gelesen)\n- Wer zählt: alle Zeilen je Segment; Kumulation ab 2026-01-01 auf unbekannten Stand 31.12.2025\n- Datenstand: unbekannt, Stichtag 2026-06-30 (Frage: heute 1. Juli 2026)\n- Nicht enthalten: MRR-Stand zum 31.12.2025; customer_master.csv nicht verwendet\n```",
